VERIFICATION

Verification is intended to assist the Chocolatey moderators and community in
verifying that this package's contents are trustworthy.

This package does not embed any binary. It downloads the official Windows
archive published by the Alera release workflow:

  https://github.com/leynier/alera/releases/download/{{TAG}}/alera-{{VERSION}}-windows.zip

The SHA-256 checksum embedded in tools\chocolateyinstall.ps1 is computed by the
release workflow (.github/workflows/release-cut.yml) from the very archive it
uploads to that release, and this package is generated and pushed by that same
workflow run.

To verify the archive yourself:

  1. Download the URL above.
  2. Run: checksum -t sha256 -f alera-{{VERSION}}-windows.zip
     (or: Get-FileHash alera-{{VERSION}}-windows.zip -Algorithm SHA256)
  3. Compare the result against the Checksum64 value in
     tools\chocolateyinstall.ps1.

The GitHub release also carries build provenance attestations, which can be
verified with:

  gh attestation verify alera-{{VERSION}}-windows.zip --repo leynier/alera

